SUMMARY
Software Engineer with 2+ years of experience designing and developing scalable full-stack web applications using the
MERN stack, Next.js, and Golang. Proven track record delivering production systems across e-commerce, fintech-style
payments, and marketplace domains, with hands-on experience in microservices architecture, REST API design, and
third-party integrations (payments, messaging, notifications). Comfortable working across the full stack, from UI to
database to deployment.
