Integrations: Razorpay, RabbitMQ, BullMQ, Firebase, Cloudinary, Google APIs, Msg91
Tools & DevOps Exposure: Git, GitHub, Postman, Docker, Terraform, Jenkins, AWS (EC2, S3, Lambda)
